      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Chronic pelvic pain is a complex problem with a long history of attempts to elucidate the cause and to design effective therapies. This review is structured around recent articles in the field which contribute to our understanding, support certain therapeutic approaches, or describe a specific case. The pain aspects of endometriosis are included for their contribution to our understanding of pain and the difficulty encountered in managing these patients."},
